  <item>
    <title><![CDATA[Mega Menu]]></title>
    <dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The navigation in the header has two Mega Menu items. Select <strong>Explore</strong> to open its panel; <strong>Resources</strong> opens when you hover over it. Press Escape or click outside a panel to close it.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Each panel is a template part in the Mega Menu area, built with ordinary blocks in the Site Editor.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
